GIVEN row IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cross reference is borne out by the index` MEANS
    CONSIDER row's kind
    WHEN ToAProvisionOfThisText THEN `the cited identifier is in the index and its heading is the one printed` row
    WHEN ToTheSameUnitOrTheWholeAct THEN `the cited identifier is in the index and its heading is the one printed` row
    WHEN ToAnotherInstrument THEN `the cited instrument is named and is not a provision of this text` row

GIVEN row IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cited instrument is named and is not a provision of this text` MEANS
        NOT (row's instrument EQUALS "")
    AND NOT (isJust (`the provision printed as` (row's instrument)))

GIVEN row IS A CrossReference
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cited identifier is in the index and its heading is the one printed` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision printed as` (row's citedIdentifier)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's heading EQUALS row's citedHeading

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cross reference in row n is borne out by the index` MEANS
    `the cross reference is borne out by the index` (at `the cross references` n)

`the number of cross references` MEANS count `the cross references`

